    passageB1: `<p>The world was very shocked by the <strong>terrible things</strong> that terrorists did in the United States. Many leaders around the world said these actions were very bad. They think <strong>terrorism</strong> is a danger to democracy and a very bad crime against the United States.</p>

<p>Terrorists often do these things to get <strong>attention</strong> for what they believe in. The terrorists who crashed planes into the World Trade Center in New York definitely got a lot of attention. The second plane <strong>attack</strong> was even shown on TV news around the world.</p>

<p>Terrorist groups usually <strong>admit</strong> they did the violent things to get attention. But after the attack in America, no group wanted to say they did it. Also, terrorists often give a <strong>warning</strong> before they attack <strong>civilians</strong>. This did not happen in New York, and many innocent people died.</p>

<p>The United States spends a lot of money on <strong>defence</strong> and <strong>intelligence</strong>. But the attack was a complete <strong>surprise</strong>. Many Americans thought their country was too strong to be attacked. They were very shocked that terrorists could <strong>threaten</strong> their safety in this way.</p>

<p>There are many different terrorist groups in the world. They all have different reasons for what they do. Some feel there is <strong>political injustice</strong>. Others are driven by their <strong>religious beliefs</strong>, or they simply <strong>hate</strong> the people they attack. They are often like an <strong>invisible enemy</strong>, using secret ways to do brutal things, and then they disappear.</p>

<p>The most difficult terrorists to deal with are those who are ready to die for what they believe in. They hate the people they attack so much that they are ready to <strong>commit suicide</strong>, as long as they hurt the enemy. </p>

<p>World leaders now understand that many problems are <strong>global</strong>. Stopping terrorism is one of the most important things to do.</p>`,
    translationB1: `<p>Dunyo terrorchilarning Qo'shma Shtatlarda qilgan <strong>dahshatli ishlari</strong>dan juda hayratda qoldi. Dunyo bo'ylab ko'plab rahbarlar bu harakatlar juda yomon ekanligini aytdi. Ular <strong>terrorizm</strong> demokratiya uchun xavf va Qo'shma Shtatlarga qarshi juda yomon jinoyat deb hisoblashadi.</p>

<p>Terrorchilar ko'pincha o'z e'tiqodlariga <strong>e'tibor</strong> qaratish uchun shunday ishlarni qiladilar. Nyu-Yorkdagi Jahon Savdo Markaziga samolyotlarni urib tushirgan terrorchilar albatta katta e'tibor qozondi. Hatto ikkinchi samolyot <strong>hujumi</strong> butun dunyo bo'ylab telekanallarda namoyish etildi.</p>

<p>Terroristik guruhlar odatda e'tibor qozonish uchun zo'ravonlik ishlarini qilganliklarini <strong>tan oladilar</strong>. Ammo Amerikadagi hujumdan so'ng, hech bir guruh buni qilganini aytishni xohlamadi. Shuningdek, terrorchilar ko'pincha <strong>fuqarolarga</strong> hujum qilishdan oldin <strong>ogohlantirish</strong> beradilar. Nyu-Yorkda bu sodir bo'lmadi va ko'plab begunoh odamlar halok bo'ldi.</p>

<p>Qo'shma Shtatlar <strong>mudofaa</strong> va <strong>razvedkaga</strong> juda ko'p pul sarflaydi. Ammo hujum butunlay <strong>kutilmagan</strong> bo'ldi. Ko'pgina amerikaliklar o'z mamlakati hujumga uchray olmaydigan darajada kuchli deb o'ylashardi. Terrorchilar ularning xavfsizligiga shu tarzda <strong>tahdid</strong> solishi mumkinligidan ular juda hayratda qolishdi.</p>

<p>Dunyoda turli xil terrorchilik guruhlari mavjud. Ularning barchasi o'z qilayotgan ishlariga turli xil sabablarga ega. Ba'zilar <strong>siyosiy adolatsizlik</strong> bor deb hisoblaydi. Boshqalarni o'z <strong>diniy e'tiqodlari</strong> boshqaradi yoki ular shunchaki hujum qiladigan odamlarni <strong>yomon ko'radilar</strong>. Ular ko'pincha <strong>ko'rinmas dushman</strong> kabi, shafqatsiz ishlarni qilish uchun maxfiy usullardan foydalanadilar va keyin g'oyib bo'lishadi.</p>

<p>Eng qiyin terrorchilar - bu o'z e'tiqodi uchun o'lishga tayyor bo'lganlardir. Ular hujum qiladigan odamlarni shunchalik yomon ko'rishadiki, dushmanga zarar yetkazishsa bo'ldi, <strong>o'z joniga qasd qilishga</strong> ham tayyor.</p>

<p>Dunyo rahbarlari endi ko'plab muammolar <strong>global</strong> ekanligini tushunishdi. Terrorizmni to'xtatish - eng muhim ishlardan biri.</p>`,
