    passageC1: `<p>The <strong>unconscionable</strong> acts perpetrated by terrorists on United States soil sent shockwaves across the globe. The international community has been unanimous in its condemnation, recognising these atrocities as not only a heinous assault on the American people, but also a profound threat to the very foundations of democracy. Indeed, terrorist acts are often calculated, at least in part, to <strong>garner maximum exposure</strong> for the ideological cause the perpetrators champion.</p><p>The terrorists responsible for the attacks on the World Trade Center in New York undeniably achieved this objective; the second plane's impact was even broadcast live, a spectacle witnessed by millions worldwide. However, the immediate aftermath of the attacks presented an anomaly. Contrary to standard practice, where terrorist groups typically <strong>claim responsibility</strong> to amplify their message, a conspicuous silence prevailed. Furthermore, the absence of any prior warning, a feature often associated with attacks on civilian targets, <strong>compounded the tragedy</strong>, resulting in an unprecedented loss of innocent life.</p><p>That a nation as powerful and technologically advanced as the United States, a country that <strong>invests heavily in</strong> defence and intelligence, could be caught so completely off guard was a source of profound disbelief. The attacks shattered the prevailing sense of American invulnerability, exposing a vulnerability that many had deemed inconceivable. The <strong>sheer audacity</strong> of the attacks served as a rude awakening.</p><p>The motivations underpinning terrorist activity are as diverse as the groups themselves. These can <strong>stem from</strong> perceived political injustices, religious extremism, or simply a deep-seated animosity towards the targeted population. Terrorists often operate as an <strong>insidious</strong> and elusive enemy, exploiting stealth and secrecy to commit their brutal acts before melting back into the shadows. This makes them exceptionally difficult to counteract.</p><p>Perhaps the most daunting challenge lies in confronting those terrorists who demonstrate a willingness to <strong>embrace martyrdom</strong> for their cause. Driven by a fanatical hatred, they are prepared to sacrifice their own lives, provided they can inflict significant casualties on their perceived enemy. The international community now fully appreciates the <strong>transnational nature</strong> of contemporary challenges, and the imperative to <strong>eradicate</strong> terrorism stands as one of the most pressing priorities on the global agenda. To that end, international cooperation must be <strong>bolstered</strong> to prevent future attacks and <strong>dismantle terrorist networks</strong> at their roots. The <strong>far-reaching consequences</strong> of inaction are simply too great to contemplate.</p>`,
    translationC1: `<p>Terrorchilarning Amerika Qo'shma Shtatlari hududida sodir etgan <strong>vijdonni larzaga soluvchi</strong> harakatlari butun dunyoga dahshat solgan to'lqinlar yubordi. Xalqaro hamjamiyat bu vahshiyliklarni nafaqat Amerika xalqiga nisbatan qilingan jirkanch hujum, balki demokratiya asoslariga chuqur tahdid sifatida e'tirof etib, bir ovozdan qoraladi. Haqiqatan ham, terrorchilik harakatlari ko'pincha, hech bo'lmaganda qisman, jinoyatchilar himoya qilayotgan mafkuraviy g'oyaga <strong>maksimal darajada e'tibor qaratish</strong> uchun hisoblab chiqiladi.</p><p>Nyu-Yorkdagi Jahon savdo markaziga qilingan hujumlar uchun mas'ul bo'lgan terrorchilar bu maqsadga shubhasiz erishdilar; ikkinchi samolyotning urilishi hatto jonli efirda namoyish etildi, bu tomoshani butun dunyo bo'ylab millionlab odamlar ko'rdi. Biroq, hujumlardan keyingi darhol yuzaga kelgan holat g'ayrioddiy edi. Terrorchilik guruhlari odatda o'z xabarlarini kuchaytirish uchun <strong>javobgarlikni o'z zimmasiga olish</strong> amaliyotidan farqli o'laroq, sezilarli sukut saqlanib qoldi. Bundan tashqari, tinch aholiga qilingan hujumlar bilan bog'liq bo'lgan oldindan ogohlantirishning yo'qligi <strong>fojiani yanada og'irlashtirdi</strong> va natijada begunoh odamlarning misli ko'rilmagan yo'qotilishiga olib keldi.</p><p>AQSh kabi qudratli va texnologik jihatdan rivojlangan davlat, mudofaa va razvedkaga <strong>katta sarmoya kiritadigan</strong> mamlakatning bunday butunlay ogoh bo'lmay qolishi chuqur ishonchsizlik manbai edi. Hujumlar Amerika daxlsizligi haqidagi hukmron tuyg'uni yo'q qilib, ko'pchilik tasavvur qilib bo'lmaydigan zaiflikni ochib berdi. Hujumlarning <strong>o'ta jur'atliligi</strong> qo'pol uyg'onish bo'ldi.</p><p>Terrorchilik faoliyatini qo'llab-quvvatlovchi motivlar guruhlarning o'zi kabi xilma-xildir. Ular <strong>kelib chiqishi mumkin</strong> bo'lgan siyosiy adolatsizliklar, diniy ekstremizm yoki shunchaki nishonga olingan aholiga nisbatan chuqur adovat bo'lishi mumkin. Terrorchilar ko'pincha yashirin va sirli dushman sifatida harakat qilib, shafqatsiz harakatlarini sodir etish uchun yashirinlik va maxfiylikdan foydalanadilar va keyin soyalarga qaytib ketadilar. Bu ularga qarshi kurashishni juda qiyinlashtiradi.</p><p>Ehtimol, eng qiyin muammo - o'z maqsadlari uchun <strong>shahidlikni qabul qilishga</strong> tayyor bo'lgan terrorchilarga qarshi turishdir. Fanatik nafrat bilan harakat qilib, ular o'z jonlarini qurbon qilishga tayyor, agar ular o'zlarining dushman deb hisoblaganlariga katta talofat yetkaza olsalar. Xalqaro hamjamiyat hozirgi zamonaviy muammolarning <strong>transmilliy xususiyatini</strong> to'liq anglab yetdi va terrorizmni <strong>yo'q qilish</strong> global kun tartibidagi eng dolzarb vazifalardan biri hisoblanadi. Shu maqsadda, kelajakdagi hujumlarning oldini olish va terrorchilik tarmoqlarini ildizidan <strong>yo'q qilish</strong> uchun xalqaro hamkorlikni <strong>kuchaytirish</strong> kerak. Harakatsizlikning <strong>keng ko'lamli oqibatlari</strong> haqida o'ylashning o'zi juda dahshatli.</p>`,
